    "/api/v2/policy/{resource_type}/{resource_id}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get Resource Policy",
        "description": "Get user group permission policy for a specific resource.\n\nParameters:\n- **resource_type**: Resource type (cloud, project, organization)\n- **resource_id**: Resource ID (e.g. cld_abc123, prj_xyz789).\n  For organization type, this parameter is ignored - your own organization is used.\n\nReturns:\n```\n{\n    \"result\": {\n        \"bindings\": [\n            {\"role_name\": \"write\", \"principals\": [\"ug_abc123\"]},\n            {\"role_name\": \"readonly\", \"principals\": [\"ug_def456\", \"ug_ghi789\"]}\n        ]\n    }\n}\n```\n\nPermission requirements:\n- Caller must have read access to the organization",
        "operationId": "get_resource_policy_api_v2_policy__resource_type___resource_id__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResourceType"
            },
            "name": "resource_type",
            "in": "path"
          },
          {
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Resource Id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "name": "resource_id",
            "in": "path"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PolicyresponseResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "put": {
        "summary": "Update Resource Policy",
        "description": "Set user group permission policy for a specific resource.\n\nParameters:\n- **resource_type**: Resource type (cloud, project, organization)\n- **resource_id**: Resource ID (e.g. cld_abc123, prj_xyz789).\n  For organization type, your own organization is used automatically.\n- **policy**: Policy configuration with role bindings\n\nValid role_name values by resource type:\n\n**Cloud**:\n- `write`: Read/write access (create, read, update, delete)\n- `readonly`: Read-only access\n\n**Project**:\n- `write`: Read/write access (create, read, update)\n- `readonly`: Read-only access\n\n**Organization**:\n- `owner`: Full control (write + collaborator management)\n- `collaborator`: Read/write access to organization resources\n\nExample:\n```\nPUT /policy/cloud/cld_abc123\nBody: {\n    \"bindings\": [\n        {\"role_name\": \"write\", \"principals\": [\"ug_abc123\"]},\n        {\"role_name\": \"readonly\", \"principals\": [\"ug_def456\", \"ug_ghi789\"]}\n    ]\n}\n```\n\nPermission requirements:\n- Caller must be an organization admin",
        "operationId": "update_resource_policy_api_v2_policy__resource_type___resource_id__put",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResourceType"
            },
            "name": "resource_type",
            "in": "path"
          },
          {
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Resource Id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "name": "resource_id",
            "in": "path"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdatePolicyRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v2/policy/{resource_type}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "List Resource Policies",
        "description": "List permission policies for all resources of a specific type in the current organization.\n\nParameters:\n- **resource_type**: Resource type to list policies for. Must be 'clouds' or 'projects'.\n\nReturns:\n```\n{\n    \"results\": [\n        {\n            \"resource_id\": \"cld_abc123\",\n            \"resource_type\": \"cloud\",\n            \"bindings\": [\n                {\"role_name\": \"write\", \"principals\": [\"ug_abc123\"]},\n                {\"role_name\": \"readonly\", \"principals\": [\"ug_def456\"]}\n            ]\n        }\n    ],\n    \"metadata\": {\n        \"count\": 1\n    }\n}\n```\n\nPermission requirements:\n- Caller must be an admin of the organization",
        "operationId": "list_resource_policies_api_v2_policy__resource_type__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Resource Type",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "name": "resource_type",
            "in": "path"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResourcepolicyitemListResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
