      "post": {
        "summary": "Bulk Delete Lineage Artifacts",
        "description": "Bulk delete Anyscale tracked artifacts (soft delete).\n\nAccepts up to 50 artifact IDs. Each deletion is processed independently,\nallowing partial success. Check the status of each result in the response.\n\nRequires write permission on at least one project linked to each artifact.",
